.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488250/ss_2fc571d4f973f4fb9f70c19651d2f6b13283c5f0.600x338.jpg?t=1772530761"}],"short_description":"Ploko is a relaxing VR experience where each model you build comes to life before your very eyes. With your camera, explore these miniature worlds, discover their hidden secrets and let your imagination run wild.","steam_appid":2488250,"support_info":{"email":"ploko.vr@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}